          "strayHtml": "<div class=\"table-wrap\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Tool</th>\n              <th>Question it answers</th>\n              <th>Key formula</th>\n              <th>Decision rule</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td><strong>CI with z</strong></td>\n              <td>Where is μ, when σ is known?</td>\n              <td>\\(\\displaystyle \\mu = \\bar{x} \\pm z\\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}\\)</td>\n              <td>Wider z → wider interval</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><strong>CI with t</strong></td>\n              <td>Where is μ, when σ is unknown?</td>\n              <td>\\(\\displaystyle \\mu = \\bar{x} \\pm t\\frac{s}{\\sqrt{n}}\\)</td>\n              <td>df = n−1, t always &gt; z</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><strong>Q-test</strong></td>\n              <td>Is this single point an outlier?</td>\n              <td>\\(\\displaystyle Q_{\\exp} = \\frac{\\text{gap}}{\\text{range}}\\)</td>\n              <td>\\(Q_{\\exp} &gt; Q_{\\text{crit}}\\) → reject</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td><strong>t-test</strong></td>\n              <td>Are two datasets significantly different?</td>\n              <td>\\(\\displaystyle t_{\\exp} = \\frac{|\\bar{x}_1 - \\bar{x}_2|}{s_{\\text{pooled}}\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}}}\\)</td>\n              <td>\\(t_{\\exp} &gt; t_{\\text{crit}}\\) → different</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>"
